{"content":[{"c":["COUNSEL, COUNSELOR"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Advice; adviser, especially on legal matters (such as a lawyer). In Bible times a counselor in a king’s court was like a U.S. cabinet member today. A counselor might at times have been in line to succeed the king. Ahithophel, counselor to David and Absalom, gave advice as sound as the “oracle of God” (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.16.23","r":"2Sam.16.23","rawR":"2Sam.16.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.16.23","value":"2Sam.16.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 16:23"},"). The elders of Israel counseled King Rehoboam (",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.12.6","r":"1Kgs.12.6","rawR":"1Kgs.12.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.12.6","value":"1Kgs.12.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 12:6"},"), as did the friends with whom Rehoboam had grown up (vv ",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.12.7-8","r":"1Kgs.12.7-8","rawR":"1Kgs.12.7-8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.12.7-8","value":"1Kgs.12.7-8"}],"t":"ref","v":"7-8"},"), although his friends gave poor advice. The Bible mentions official counselors in Egypt (",{"href":"?bref=Isa.19.11","r":"Isa.19.11","rawR":"Isa.19.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.19.11","value":"Isa.19.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 19:11"},") and Babylon (",{"href":"?bref=Dan.3.2-3","r":"Dan.3.2-3","rawR":"Dan.3.2-3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Dan.3.2-3","value":"Dan.3.2-3"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dn 3:2-3"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["A wise person seeks counsel when making plans: “Plans go wrong for lack of advice; many counselors bring success” (",{"href":"?bref=Pr.15.22","r":"Pr.15.22","rawR":"Pr.15.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Pr.15.22","value":"Pr.15.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"Prv 15:22"},", ",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},"). One’s counselors may be one’s parents (",{"href":"?bref=Pr.1.8","r":"Pr.1.8","rawR":"Pr.1.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Pr.1.8","value":"Pr.1.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"1:8"},"), older people (",{"href":"?bref=Ezek.7.26","r":"Ezek.7.26","rawR":"Ezek.7.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezek.7.26","value":"Ezek.7.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ez 7:26"},"), prophets (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.25.16","r":"2Chr.25.16","rawR":"2Chr.25.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.25.16","value":"2Chr.25.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 25:16"},"), wise men (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.18.18","r":"Jer.18.18","rawR":"Jer.18.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.18.18","value":"Jer.18.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 18:18"},"), or friends (",{"href":"?bref=Pr.27.9","r":"Pr.27.9","rawR":"Pr.27.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Pr.27.9","value":"Pr.27.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"Prv 27:9"},", ",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},"). Some counselors are evil, giving deceitful advice (",{"href":"?bref=Pr.12.5","r":"Pr.12.5","rawR":"Pr.12.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Pr.12.5","value":"Pr.12.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Prv 12:5"},")."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"},{"c":["According to the Bible, God also counsels. He frustrates the counsel of the nations who oppose him (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.33.10","r":"Ps.33.10","rawR":"Ps.33.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.33.10","value":"Ps.33.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 33:10"},"), but his own counsel endures for many generations (v ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.33.11","r":"Ps.33.11","rawR":"Ps.33.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.33.11","value":"Ps.33.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"11"},"). No one may counsel the Lord (",{"href":"?bref=Isa.40.13","r":"Isa.40.13","rawR":"Isa.40.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.40.13","value":"Isa.40.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 40:13"},"). His Messiah is called “Wonderful Counselor” (",{"href":"?bref=Isa.9.6","r":"Isa.9.6","rawR":"Isa.9.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.9.6","value":"Isa.9.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"9:6"},")."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"},{"c":["According to the NT, the Spirit counsels or comforts believers (",{"href":"?bref=John.14.16-17","r":"John.14.16-17","rawR":"John.14.16-17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"John.14.16-17","value":"John.14.16-17"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jn 14:16-17"},"). Christ sends the Holy Spirit to his people (",{"href":"?bref=John.16.7","r":"John.16.7","rawR":"John.16.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"John.16.7","value":"John.16.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"16:7"},"), and the Spirit, also called the Spirit of truth, bears witness to Christ (",{"href":"?bref=John.15.26","r":"John.15.26","rawR":"John.15.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"John.15.26","value":"John.15.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"15:26"},"). The ascended Jesus Christ is seen as a counselor in God’s heavenly court (",{"href":"?bref=1Jn.2.1","r":"1Jn.2.1","rawR":"1Jn.2.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Jn.2.1","value":"1Jn.2.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Jn 2:1"},", “advocate”)."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=SpiritofGod_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"SpiritofGod_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"SpiritofGod_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Spirit of God"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"CounselCounselor","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Sm 16:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.16.23","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.16.23","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.16.23"},{"anchorText":"1 Kgs 12:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Kgs.12.6","rawQueryValue":"1Kgs.12.6","sourceRefExact":"1Kgs.12.6"},{"anchorText":"7-8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Kgs.12.7-8","rawQueryValue":"1Kgs.12.7-8","sourceRefExact":"1Kgs.12.7-8"},{"anchorText":"Is 19:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.19.11","rawQueryValue":"Isa.19.11","sourceRefExact":"Isa.19.11"},{"anchorText":"Dn 3:2-3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Dan.3.2-3","rawQueryValue":"Dan.3.2-3","sourceRefExact":"Dan.3.2-3"},{"anchorText":"Prv 15:22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Pr.15.22","rawQueryValue":"Pr.15.22","sourceRefExact":"Pr.15.22"},{"anchorText":"1:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Pr.1.8","rawQueryValue":"Pr.1.8","sourceRefExact":"Pr.1.8"},{"anchorText":"Ez 7:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezek.7.26","rawQueryValue":"Ezek.7.26","sourceRefExact":"Ezek.7.26"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 25:16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.25.16","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.25.16","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.25.16"},{"anchorText":"Jer 18:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.18.18","rawQueryValue":"Jer.18.18","sourceRefExact":"Jer.18.18"},{"anchorText":"Prv 27:9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Pr.27.9","rawQueryValue":"Pr.27.9","sourceRefExact":"Pr.27.9"},{"anchorText":"Prv 12:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Pr.12.5","rawQueryValue":"Pr.12.5","sourceRefExact":"Pr.12.5"},{"anchorText":"Ps 33:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ps.33.10","rawQueryValue":"Ps.33.10","sourceRefExact":"Ps.33.10"},{"anchorText":"11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ps.33.11","rawQueryValue":"Ps.33.11","sourceRefExact":"Ps.33.11"},{"anchorText":"Is 40:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.40.13","rawQueryValue":"Isa.40.13","sourceRefExact":"Isa.40.13"},{"anchorText":"9:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.9.6","rawQueryValue":"Isa.9.6","sourceRefExact":"Isa.9.6"},{"anchorText":"Jn 14:16-17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=John.14.16-17","rawQueryValue":"John.14.16-17","sourceRefExact":"John.14.16-17"},{"anchorText":"16:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=John.16.7","rawQueryValue":"John.16.7","sourceRefExact":"John.16.7"},{"anchorText":"15:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=John.15.26","rawQueryValue":"John.15.26","sourceRefExact":"John.15.26"},{"anchorText":"1 Jn 2:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Jn.2.1","rawQueryValue":"1Jn.2.1","sourceRefExact":"1Jn.2.1"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"96d250c9fd997395fcee652f708d936328ead2ead78655d0c0f092fee0c4bb9e","sourceItemName":"CounselCounselor","sourceItemOrder":295,"sourceMember":"Articles/C.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"CounselCounselor","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Counsel, Counselor","title":"Counsel, Counselor","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}